<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Book-search listings from normal channel searches were removed.</strong> The BookSearch plugin treated every completed SearchBot listing as its own, parsed it, and deleted the archive. It now processes and removes a listing only after a search started with <code>/bsearch</code>; normal <code>@search</code> listings stay in Downloads.</li>
</ul>
